      "text": [
        " أَوَّلِ اَلْوَقْتِ أَوْ يُؤَخِّرُ قَلِيلاً وَ يُصَلِّي بِأَهْلِ مَسْجِدِهِ إِذَا كَانَ إِمَامَهُمْ قَالَ «يُؤَخِّرُ وَ يُصَلِّي بِأَهْلِ مَسْجِدِهِ إِذَا كَانَ هُوَ اَلْإِمَامَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1120 - Jamil ibn Salih asked:\n\"Which is better, for a man to pray by himself at the beginning of the time (for prayer) or to delay a little and pray with the people of his mosque if he is their Imam?\"\nHe (as) replied: \"He should delay and pray with the people of his mosque if he is their Imam.\""
        ]
      }
